WEBVTT

00:01:56.329 --> 00:02:00.579
contributes 16% 
of greenhouse gas emissions.

00:02:00.579 --> 00:02:05.871
Even before we use any of these things,
making them produces emissions—

00:02:05.871 --> 00:02:07.996
a lot of emissions.

00:02:07.996 --> 00:02:09.496
Making materials—

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:13.704
concrete, steel, plastic, glass, 
aluminum and everything else—

00:02:13.704 --> 00:02:17.579
accounts for 31%
of greenhouse gas emissions.

00:02:17.579 --> 00:02:23.663
Concrete alone is responsible for 8% 
of all carbon emissions worldwide.

00:02:23.663 --> 00:02:27.621
And it’s much more difficult to reduce 
the emissions from concrete

00:02:27.621 --> 00:02:30.329
than from other building materials.